{"seq":2,"slug":"kinematics-and-coordinate-systems","title":"坐标系与运动学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/robot-structure-principles/kinematics-and-coordinate-systems","wordCount":1657,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"坐标系与运动学\">坐标系与运动学</h1><p>我承认，&quot;运动学&quot;这三个字一度把我劝退过。直到有人对我说了一句话：机器人内部只知道每个关节转了多少度，而你想要的是工具尖到了空间哪个点——把这两件事对上号，就是运动学的全部任务。这么一想，它立刻从抽象数学变成了一个很实在的翻译问题。这一节我们就来当这个翻译。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><ul>\n<li>机器人里有两套语言：<strong>关节坐标</strong>（每个轴转了多少角度）和<strong>笛卡尔坐标</strong>（末端工具在空间里的 X、Y、Z 位置加上姿态）。</li>\n<li><strong>正运动学</strong>：已知各关节角度，求末端工具的位姿。它的解是唯一的、确定的。</li>\n<li><strong>逆运动学</strong>：已知想要的末端位姿，反求各关节该转多少。它可能有多个解，也可能无解。</li>\n<li>常用的几个坐标系：<strong>基坐标系</strong>（固定在底座）、<strong>工具坐标系（TCP）</strong>（跟着工具尖走）、<strong>工件坐标系</strong>（绑在工件或工作台上）。</li>\n<li><strong>D-H 参数</strong>是描述连杆和关节几何关系的一套标准化方法，是建立运动学模型的通用语言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"两套坐标语言\">两套坐标语言</h3><p>伸出你的手臂，闭上眼睛，把肩、肘、腕分别转一个角度。你的大脑此刻记的是&quot;每个关节转了多少&quot;，这就是<strong>关节坐标</strong>。现在睁开眼，看你的指尖停在了桌面上方某个位置——这个空间位置就是<strong>笛卡尔坐标</strong>。同一个动作，两种描述。</p>\n<p>机器人也一样。它的编码器只能告诉控制器&quot;J1 转了 30 度，J2 转了 45 度……&quot;，但操作工想的是&quot;把焊枪移到工件左上角那个孔上&quot;。两套语言之间的来回翻译，正是控制柜每一刻都在做的事。</p>\n<h3 id=\"正运动学-从关节角到位姿\">正运动学：从关节角到位姿</h3><p>正运动学回答的问题是：六个关节都转到指定角度，工具尖最终在哪？因为每个关节怎么转、连杆多长都是固定已知的，所以答案唯一确定，像搭积木一样一节一节往上算就行。</p>\n<p>机器人学里用一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>齐次变换矩阵</strong>来描述&quot;从一个连杆坐标系到下一个连杆坐标系&quot;的位置和姿态变化。把相邻连杆的变换矩阵依次相乘，就得到从基座到末端的总变换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>6</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_6^0 = T_1^0 \\cdot T_2^1 \\cdot T_3^2 \\cdot T_4^3 \\cdot T_5^4 \\cdot T_6^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i^{i-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1417em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8648em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由该关节的 D-H 参数（连杆长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>、连杆扭角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、连杆偏距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、关节角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>）算出。你现在不需要会手算这个矩阵乘法，只要理解：<strong>正运动学就是把一串关节角，通过连乘矩阵，确定地翻译成一个空间位姿</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"逆运动学-从位姿反推关节角\">逆运动学：从位姿反推关节角</h3><p>逆运动学要难得多，也有趣得多。你给定目标位姿，问每个关节该转多少。问题在于：到达同一个点，机器人往往有多种&quot;姿势&quot;。</p>\n<p>还是用手臂打比方：想用指尖摸到面前桌上同一个点，你可以肘朝上、也可以肘朝下，手臂的整体形态完全不同，但指尖位置一样。机器人六轴常见的多解就有&quot;肘上/肘下&quot;&quot;翻腕/不翻腕&quot;等组合，理论上可达 8 组解。控制器要根据当前姿态、运动连续性、是否会碰撞等因素，挑一个最合适的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[目标位姿 X Y Z 姿态] --&gt; B[逆运动学求解]&#10;  B --&gt; C[解1 肘上]&#10;  B --&gt; D[解2 肘下]&#10;  B --&gt; E[解n 翻腕等]&#10;  C --&gt; F[选择策略 连续性 避碰 限位]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[输出一组关节角]\">graph LR\n  A[目标位姿 X Y Z 姿态] --&gt; B[逆运动学求解]\n  B --&gt; C[解1 肘上]\n  B --&gt; D[解2 肘下]\n  B --&gt; E[解n 翻腕等]\n  C --&gt; F[选择策略 连续性 避碰 限位]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[输出一组关节角]</pre><p>如果目标点超出了机器人的可达范围，或者落在&quot;奇异点&quot;附近，逆运动学就会无解或解不稳定——这也是实际编程中常见的&quot;无法到达&quot;报警的根源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个常用坐标系\">三个常用坐标系</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>坐标系</th>\n<th>原点在哪</th>\n<th>用来做什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基坐标系</td>\n<td>固定在机器人底座</td>\n<td>描述机器人在世界中的整体定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具坐标系 TCP</td>\n<td>工具的工作点（如焊枪尖、夹爪中心）</td>\n<td>让示教和运动围绕真正干活的那个点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工件坐标系</td>\n<td>绑在工件或夹具上</td>\n<td>工件挪位置后，程序只改坐标系不改每个点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正确标定 TCP 极其重要。如果焊枪换了一把、长度变了却不重新标 TCP，机器人以为工作点还在老地方，焊缝就会整体偏移。这是新手最常踩的坑之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用你自己的手臂演示&quot;肘上&quot;和&quot;肘下&quot;两种姿势让指尖停在同一点。这个直觉对应机器人逆运动学的哪个特性？为什么控制器需要一个选解策略？</li>\n<li>工件坐标系的核心好处是&quot;工件挪了，程序里只改一个坐标系就行&quot;。设想一个不用工件坐标系的程序：如果夹具向右平移了 50mm，你需要改动多少个示教点？</li>\n<li>思考题：正运动学的解唯一，逆运动学的解可能有多个甚至没有。这两者的&quot;难易不对称&quot;在生活里还有哪些类似的例子？（提示：从结果倒推原因往往比从原因推结果难。）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>如果你想动手，MATLAB 的 Robotics Toolbox 或开源的 Python 库（如 roboticstoolbox-python）可以载入 ABB IRB1200 等真实机型，亲手跑一遍正、逆运动学，看着关节角和末端位姿互相转换。</li>\n<li>&quot;奇异点&quot;是个值得后续深挖的概念：当机器人某些关节轴线共线时，会丢失自由度、关节速度骤增。了解它能帮你理解很多&quot;机器人走到某处突然报警急停&quot;的现象。</li>\n<li>D-H 参数法分标准型和改进型两种约定，初学时不必纠结区别，先建立&quot;用四个参数描述一节连杆&quot;的整体印象即可。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们把运动学还原成了一个翻译问题：关节坐标和笛卡尔坐标之间来回换算。正运动学从关节角确定地求出位姿，逆运动学从位姿反求关节角、可能多解或无解。我们还认识了基坐标系、工具坐标系、工件坐标系三套常用参照，尤其要记牢 TCP 标定的重要性。下一节我们落到更硬的部件上——驱动电机和减速器，看看机器人的&quot;力气&quot;和&quot;精度&quot;到底从哪来。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"坐标系与运动学","id":"坐标系与运动学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"两套坐标语言","id":"两套坐标语言"},{"level":3,"text":"正运动学：从关节角到位姿","id":"正运动学-从关节角到位姿"},{"level":3,"text":"逆运动学：从位姿反推关节角","id":"逆运动学-从位姿反推关节角"},{"level":3,"text":"三个常用坐标系","id":"三个常用坐标系"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"机器人的组成与常见类型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/robot-structure-principles/robot-anatomy-and-types"},"next":{"title":"驱动与传动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/robot-structure-principles/drive-and-transmission"}}